      "message": "@ffilzlnx@mindspring.com, this is an important fix\n\nthe gsh_buffdesc we get is not necessarily null terminated, it has a pointer to the used supplied input in the request which may not be null terminated and it can cause security issues",
      "revId": "e8e95e47e76ea2f12ad25cf05639ec9c522520a5",
